CORE
main.c
--program-only
^\(\d+\) counter#\d+ == 2$
^EXIT=0$
^SIGNAL=0$
--
SHARED_WRITE
SHARED_READ
--
Writes to global and to address-taken local objects were recorded as shared
write events, for the memory model of a program with several threads.  No
thread can be started here, so there are none: the equation is shorter and
constant propagation is not affected.
